      "portrait_expression": "cautious",
      "setting_description": "Tala's living quarters behind cookstall",
      "prompt": "The room behind my stall is... it's the only space that's entirely mine. I haven't shared it with anyone since I left the caves. But I have more space than I use, and you work well. If you can help with the evening prep and keep things clean, you can stay here.",
